# Public host builds accept source files only, never provisioned worker binaries,
# bundles or model data from the checkout. Keep this aligned with publicSource in Nix.
**
!**/
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!verifier/**/Cargo.toml
!verifier/**/*.rs
!verifier/sandbox-client/worker.policy
**/target/
**/.git/
